OL,3,GNEWSAMr Doodle transforms children's
OL,4,Ahospital courtyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe illustrator and artist Sam Cox -
OL,7,Fbetter known as Mr Doodle - has
OL,8,Ftransformed a  courtyard at a
OL,9,Fchildren's hospital into a "truly
OL,10,Fmagical" space with his signature
OL,11,Fsquiggles.
OL,13,FAfter asking for ideas to transform the
OL,14,Fspace on social media, the Friends of
OL,15,FConquest Hospital in St Leonards, East
OL,16,FSussex, joined forces with Mr Doodle.
OL,18,F"What was once a rather boring view of
OL,19,Fa somewhat uncared for courtyard is now
OL,20,Fa place of wonder, " said Jo Clark,
OL,21,Fgeneral manager at the hospital.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
