OL,3,GNEWSAMr Doodle transforms children's
OL,4,Ahospital courtyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe says the mural provides vital
OL,7,Fdistraction and comfort for the
OL,8,Fhospital's youngest patients during
OL,9,Fwhat can be a stressful time for
OL,10,Fchildren and families.
